    "text": "WBIR\nwebsite\nRoane County, Tennessee\nI-40 East closed near Kingston in Roane County after serious crash\n5 hours ago\nROANE COUNTY, Tenn. — I-40 East in Roane County has been shut down near Mile Marker 359.8 at Buttermilk Road after a multi-vehicle crash, according to the Tennessee Department of Transportation. TDOT said the crash was reported around 6:38 p.m. east of Kingston, with a view from a SmartWay...\n1",
